、金属反光、自然景深，无额外人物、无多余手脚、无畸形脚趾、无水印。\n\n右上角以黑色清晰无衬线字体分两行写：“Qwen Image 2.1”。"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "title": "编码与条件 · 497", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#252b35", "size": [505.148193359375, 375.2469787597656], "pos": [2601.9921875, 120], "id": 497, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [{"name": "GUIDER", "links": [787], "label": "GUIDER", "type": "GUIDER"}], "color": "#976179", "widgets_values": [1], "inputs": [{"name": "model", "link": 790, "label": "model", "type": "MODEL"}, {"name": "positive", "link": 791, "label": "positive", "type": "CONDITIONING"}, {"name": "negative", "link": 792, "label": "negative", "type": "CONDITIONING"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg"}, "name": "cfg", "label": "cfg", "type": "FLOAT"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CFGGuider", "title": "采样生成 · 505", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#252b35", "size": [390, 210], "pos": [3257.62890625, 400], "id": 505, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"cfg": true}, "Node name for S&R": "CFGGuider"}, "order": 27}, {"outputs": [{"name": "SAMPLER", "links": [788], "label": "SAMPLER", "type": "SAMPLER"}], "color": "#976179", "widgets_values": ["euler"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "sampler_name"}, "name": "sampler_name", "label": "sampler_name", "type": "COMBO"}], "flags": {}, "type": "KSamplerSelect", "title": "采样生成 · 508", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#252b35", "size": [390, 210], "pos": [3257.62890625, 120], "id": 508, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"sampler_name": true}, "Node name for S&R": "KSamplerSelect"}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [{"name": "SIGMAS", "links": [789], "label": "SIGMAS", "type": "SIGMAS"}], "color": "#646e80", "widgets_values": ["1.0, 0.978453, 0.95418, 0.926626, 0.89508, 0.845148, 0.704534, 0.414568, 0"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "sigmas"}, "name": "sigmas", "label": "sigmas", "type": "STRING"}], "flags": {}, 